# Pipeline standards

- Async I/O everywhere (`async def`, `httpx.AsyncClient`).
- Pydantic v2 models at boundaries; no raw dicts across layers.
- Folders: `api/`, `core/`, `db/`, `services/`, `tests/`.
- Typed errors from `core/errors.py` with app-level handlers.
- No placeholders in production code. Mock Supabase and JSONPlaceholder in tests.
